      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Pompano in Paradise – Luxury 30A Beach Villa<br><br>Welcome to Pompano in Paradise, a stunning coastal getaway nestled in desirable Inlet Beach, just minutes from the sugar-white sands and vibrant communities of Seaside, Rosemary Beach, and WaterColor. This beautifully designed 3-bedroom, 4.5-bath villa comfortably accommodates up to 11 guests, combining luxury finishes with thoughtful amenities for an unforgettable beach vacation.<br><br><br><br>Property Highlights<br><br>Sleeps up to 11 guests<br><br>Prime Inlet Beach location — 3-4 minute walk to the beach<br><br>Resort-style community pool just steps away<br><br>Two private balconies + covered porch<br><br>4 adult bikes included for scenic rides on the 30A trail<br><br>Stylish coastal décor and premium comforts throughout<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements & Room Details<br><br>First Floor — Flexible Family Space<br><br>Queen Bedroom: Comfortable queen bed with access to a full bathroom.<br><br>Bunk Seating Area: Twin bunk beds cleverly integrated into the living space — perfect for kids or extra guests (shares proximity to the first floor bath).<br><br>Second Floor — Primary Suite<br><br>King Bedroom: Spacious suite with luxurious king bed and direct access to a beautifully appointed bathroom.<br><br>Third Floor – Guest Retreat + Loft Bunk Area<br><br>Queen Bedroom: Cozy queen bed with private retreat vibes.<br><br>Loft Bunk Area: This open common loft space features a Twin XL over Queen bunk bed — ideal for kids or additional guests but not enclosed as a separate bedroom. It’s a fun, airy spot for sleeping and lounging with gulf breezes and views from the upper level.<br><br>Why You’ll Love It<br><br>Pompano in Paradise is designed for both relaxation and adventure. Whether you’re unwinding after a sun-filled day on the beach or spending quality time with family and friends, this home offers plenty of space and thoughtful touches to make your stay exceptional. The open floor plan and outdoor areas create a welcoming environment for gatherings and seaside living at its best.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
