    "description": [
      "Located near the beach, this vacation home is in Inlet Beach, a neighborhood in Panama City Beach. The area's natural beauty can be seen at Alys Beach and Rosemary Beach, while Frank Brown Park and Shipwreck Island Waterpark are popular area attractions. Emerald Coast Mirror Maze and SkyWheel are also worth visiting. Discover the area's water adventures with scuba diving, snorkeling, and surfing/body boarding nearby, or enjoy the great outdoors with ecotours."
